From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Dago <ydago@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 07:19:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/48] [net] Add Net.HttpAuth.SchemeAllowedByAllSchemesPolicy
 histogram

Records when an HTTP authentication challenge scheme succeeds via policy
override, despite not being permitted by the AuthSchemes policy.

The histogram records whether the challenge was for a proxy
(HttpAuth::AUTH_PROXY) or an origin server (HttpAuth::AUTH_SERVER).

Bug: 533454968
Change-Id: Ic9fd4683cb4df497f0ad112aec17da73a4bdb0dc
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8477993
Commit-Queue: Yann Dago <ydago@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Yann Dago <ydago@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: mmenke <mmenke@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Alexei Svitkine <asvitkine@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1708988}
